OL,5,G0000 Green Wing
OL,6,     FStatham is unusually cheerful, but
OL,7,     Fit will probably end in tears. Mac
OL,8,     Ffinds it hard to adjust to his new
OL,9,     Frole, Martin hires a private
OL,10,     Fdetective and Caroline has a hot
OL,11,     Fdate.
OL,12,G0105 Brooklyn Nine-Nine
OL,13,     FTerry Kitties: Jeffords enlists
OL,14,     FPeralta's help to solve a case
OL,15,     Ffrom his past. Santiago invites
OL,16,     Fherself to a competitive training
OL,17,     Fexercise with Holt and Diaz.
